@startuml
title Password change flow — FreeIPA KDB plugin

participant "Client" as C
participant "KDC" as KDC
participant "ipadb_check_pw_policy()\n[IPA]" as PWP

C -> KDC : kpasswd request
activate KDC

KDC -> KDC : ipadb_change_pwd()
activate KDC #DarkSalmon

KDC -> PWP : ipapwd_check_policy(...,\nied->pw_expiration, ...)
activate PWP
note right of PWP
    Must use ied->pw_expiration
    (the real value from LDAP),
    not db_entry->pw_expiration
    (which is 0 for passwordless-
    capable users).
end note
PWP --> KDC : policy result
deactivate PWP

deactivate KDC

KDC --> C : password change result
deactivate KDC
@enduml
